JkFlow for PS4

The JkFlow launcher
-------------------
The launcher code (the start screen, Patch, settings, help and the loader,
linked into the title sce_module/relocated_wine_app.prx) is
Copyright (c) 2026 XxXJoker13XxX and contributors.
The JkFlow launcher is licensed under LGPL-2.1-or-later: the GNU Lesser
General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation, version
2.1 or (at your option) any later version. The full text is
LICENSES/LGPL-2.1.txt. Where to get the source: SOURCES.txt.

Separate files that are not under the LGPL
------------------------------------------
These are separate DLLs that Patch copies into your Blur folder. They are
not linked into the title:
  - V7 frame pacer: blur-files/d3d9.dll (also installed as amax/dxvk.dll)
  - S7 shader fixes: blur-files/d3d9_blur_dxvk.dll (also amax/d3d9_blur_dxvk.dll)
V7 and S7 DLLs: Copyright (c) 2026 XxXJoker13XxX. All rights reserved.

Native DXVK
-----------
Our changes to DXVK in the native renderer sce_module/dxvknative.prx and its
client blur-files/d3d9.c988.dll: Copyright (c) 2026 XxXJoker13XxX. Free to
use, copy, change and redistribute, if every release names the author with
the line "Native DXVK by XxXJoker13XxX". Full terms:
LICENSES/JkFlow-Native-DXVK.txt. The DXVK base stays zlib/libpng. The source
of these changes is not published.

Third-party components
----------------------
Third-party components keep their own licences. See THIRD_PARTY.md for the
list and LICENSES/ for the full texts:
  - Wine and the Wine-based PS4 runtime: LGPL-2.1-or-later. The source, with
    our changes, is published as described in SOURCES.txt; what is not yet
    complete is listed under "Gaps" in wine/BUILD.md of the source
    repository.
  - DXVK: zlib/libpng
  - Mesa / RADV: MIT
  - Nunito font: SIL Open Font License 1.1
  - FreeType: FreeType License (FTL)
  - LLVM runtime: Apache-2.0 with the LLVM exception
  - musl libc and orbis-compat: MIT
  - mingw-w64 runtime: ZPL-2.1 and others (in d3d9.c988.dll)
  - puff (zlib contrib): Zlib
  - and the further components listed in THIRD_PARTY.md

JkFlow contains no files from Activision or AMAX. Patch for online play
downloads blur_12.zip and amax_client_files.zip from amax-emu.com straight to
your console. These files belong to their owners, and their terms apply.

Blur is a trademark of Activision. The game is not included; you use your
own copy. This is an unofficial fan project.
